The Killing matrix is \(21 \times 21\) and non-degenerate. The only possibility
is \(\mathfrak{sp}_6\). One checks that the Killing matrix has a full set of
real eigenvectors, so the isomorphism of \(\mathfrak{a}\) and
\(\mathfrak{sp}_6\) holds over the real numbers.

