powerTraces -- Compute the traces of powers of a matrix
*******************************************************

Description
===========

This is what you do:



+--------------------------------------+
|i1 : ea = exteriorExtension(3, 6, QQ);|
+--------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = ea.ad(first ea.bases#1);     |
|                                      |
|              55       55             |
|o2 : Matrix QQ   <-- QQ               |
+--------------------------------------+
|i3 : ea.powerTraces A                 |
|                                      |
|     +-----+-----+----+               |
|o3 = |power|trace|rank|               |
|     +-----+-----+----+               |
|     |1    |0    |20  |               |
|     +-----+-----+----+               |
|     |2    |0    |1   |               |
|     +-----+-----+----+               |
+--------------------------------------+

The list outputs the trace of each power until the power ranks stabilize, or
until the power is equal to the dimension of the algebra. These are invariants
of the element x in ad(x).



