structureTensor -- Constructs the structureTensor of the ExteriorExtension
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

The structure tensor of an algebra is the representative of the bilinear
product as a hypermatrix. The matrices constructed by this can get very large,
and take a long time to compute. The output can be very large, so we return a
hashTable with only the non-zero values.



