KillingMatrix -- Constructs the Killing matrix of the ExteriorExtension
***********************************************************************

Description
===========

The Killling matrix is constructed by taking the adjoint of every basis vector
of the algebra, then computing the trace of each bracket between them and
storing the results in a matrix. The matrices constructed by this can get very
large, and take a long time to compute.



